  partName: Left Valve Cover Gasket (2)
  description: The Left Valve Cover Gasket (2) is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned
    at the top-left-center of the engine, sealing the valve cover to prevent oil
    leaks. Made of Frame material, this gasket is essential for maintaining the engine's
    performance and longevity. Notably, the Left Valve Cover Gasket (2) works in
    conjunction with the Center Valve Cover Gasket to ensure a secure seal around
    the valve cover.
